      "flavourText": "",
      "sidebarText": "<h3 class=\"title\">Losing a Head</h3>An ettin who loses one of its heads is a sorry sight indeed. Rather than clean and cauterize the stump, an ettin will typically leave as much of its decapitated head attached as possible, even possibly attempting to sew a completely severed head back on or keep it in a knapsack strung around its shoulder.",
